Package: csas-pohoda
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 python3,
 csas-statement-tools (>= 0.1.3),
 pohoda-abo-importer (>= 1.0.1)
Description: Import Česká spořitelna statements into Pohoda
 Downloads bank statements from Česká spořitelna (CSAS) in the ABO format
 using csas-statement-downloader and imports the bank movements into the
 Pohoda accounting software through mServer using pohoda-abo-importer.
 .
 The import is idempotent, already imported movements are skipped.

Package: multiflexi-csas-pohoda
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 csas-pohoda (= ${binary:Version}),
 multiflexi-cli,
 multiflexi-csas,
 multiflexi-mserver
Description: MultiFlexi integration of csas-pohoda
 MultiFlexi application definition which runs the import of Česká spořitelna
 statements into Pohoda with the Csas and mServer credentials.
